    <string name="changelog_title">What\'s new in %1$s</string>
    <string name="changelog_text_v1_0_3">🔹 Direct access to book details by tapping its cover in Activity.
🔹 Option to follow users directly from reviews.
🔹 It is now possible to reply and like ActivityPub posts.
🔹 Reviews are sorted from newest to oldest.
🔹 Fixed the bug when publishing reviews and follower counters.
🔹 Internal stability improvements and reduced battery consumption.</string>
<string name="search_tab_books">"Books"</string><string name="search_tab_users">"Users"</string><string name="search_hint_users">"Search users"</string><string name="search_btn_users">"Search user"</string><string name="search_users_info">To find local users, type their name. For users on other instances, use the format user@instance.com</string><string name="search_users_empty">No users found</string><string name="user_profile_title">"User Profile"</string><string name="user_profile_no_name">"No name"</string><string name="user_profile_no_summary">"This user has no description."</string><string name="add_book_manually_btn">Can\'t find the book? Add it manually</string>    <string name="changelog_text_v1_0_4">Expanded search: It is now possible to search for users and locate books hosted on other instances.

Comfortable reading: New \"…read more\" button to expand long reviews in the activity section.

Counter fix: Solved the bug that showed 0 followers/following.

Compatibility: Improved synchronization with Mastodon accounts.

Design: Added support for monochrome icons.</string>
