    <string name="changelog_text_v1_0_5">Quotes and reviews: You can now view them integrated directly into each book\'s details page.\n\nPolished search: Improved interface text and internal adjustments to make search more precise.\n\nNew languages: The app is now available in Catalan and Ukrainian, and includes fixes for Finnish.\n\nStability: Internal code improvements (ProGuard/Gson) to prevent runtime crashes.</string>
    <string name="changelog_text_v1_0_6">Quotes: Improved visual design and fixed the bug that duplicated the quote text.\n\nCompatibility: Updated support to work properly with BookWyrm servers on version 0.8.\n\nCounters: Fixed the calculation of the number of followers and following.</string>
    <string name="changelog_text_v1_0_7">- Connection error fix: Fixed the bug (Error 307) that prevented performing actions due to HTTPS redirection problems when logging in. It is no longer necessary to log in again.

- Followers counter: Fixed the problem on servers with BookWyrm 0.8 that showed your followers and following as 0. The app now calculates this number internally to avoid the server bug.</string>
    <string name="clear_notifications">Clear notifications</string>
    <string name="notifications_cleared">Notifications cleared</string>
    <string name="changelog_text_v1_0_8">New Notifications tab: You can now check all your notices and alerts directly from the new section in the bottom bar.\n\nDark Mode improvements: The app\'s loading screen and login now respect your phone\'s dark theme. No more bright flashes when opening the app at night!\n\nPolished visualization: Design adjustments to make reading activities more comfortable.</string>
    <string name="timeline_boost">Boost</string>
    <string name="changelog_text_v1_0_9">Share reviews: You can now easily send the reviews you read to other apps.

Reading goals: You can now view your goals directly from your profile screen.

Search fix: Fixed the bug that prevented opening book details after searching.</string>
    <string name="changelog_text_v1_1_0">Login fix: Resolved an issue that prevented loading shelves correctly when logging in using a full handle (e.g. user@instance.com).\n\nStability: Improved server response parsing to prevent crashes due to invisible characters (BOM).\n\n⚠️ Important: If your BookWyrm instance uses Cloudflare, you might occasionally experience connection errors. We are currently investigating a solution for this.</string>
    <string name="changelog_text_v1_1_1">Performance: All lists (activity, books, notifications) are now much smoother and faster.\n\nDesign: Refreshed color palette with a vibrant blue and new rounded corners.\n\nStability: Fixed crashes caused by invisible characters (BOM) in server responses.\n\n⚠️ Important: Due to technical limitations, if your BookWyrm instance (like ramblingreaders.org) uses Cloudflare security checks, the application will not be able to connect.</string>
    <string name="changelog_text_v1_1_2">- Boost button: Added the option to boost posts to share them directly on your activity timeline.\n\n- Reviews and quotes: You can now read community reviews and quotes directly from each book\'s details page.</string>
    <string name="changelog_text_v1_1_3">What\'s new in version 1.1.3:
* **Notifications:** Fixed list rendering and added support for viewing full content when tapping on them.</string>
